#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:544
msgid "Fix Arabic characters in searches"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:544
msgid ""
"Converts Arabic ي and ك to Persian ی and ک and removes tatweel, diacritics "
"and invisible characters before searching. Visitors with Arabic keyboards "
"will find your products instead of getting \"nothing found\"."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:545
msgid "Match any spelling of Persian letters and digits"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:545
msgid ""
"A search for \"سایز 63\" also finds titles written as \"سايز ۶۳\" (Arabic "
"ي/ك, Persian or Latin digits, half-space or space). Recommended: product "
"titles are often typed with different keyboards."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:546
msgid "Search in"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:546
msgid ""
"WordPress also searches the full description, so a product whose description"
" merely mentions a word (\"…can be used with a tank\") appears for that "
"word. Title only gives cleaner results for shops with descriptive titles."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:547
msgid "Rescue searches that find nothing"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:547
msgid ""
"Only when a search returns zero results: separates numbers glued to words "
"(مغزی1/2), removes text pasted from product pages, corrects words that do "
"not exist in your product titles (missing آ, typos, words written together) "
"and, if needed, searches with fewer words. Searches that already work are "
"never changed."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:548
msgid "Tell the visitor what was searched instead"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:548
msgid "Shows \"Showing results for …\" above the results, like Google."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:549
msgid "Help on empty result pages"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:549
msgid ""
"When nothing is found even after the rescue, WooCommerce result pages show "
"popular searches and the text below. For other themes use the "
"[webisearch_no_results] shortcode."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:550
msgid "Text for empty result pages"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:550
msgid ""
"Optional. Example: Didn't find it? Call us on 021-… or message us on "
"WhatsApp — we probably have it."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:551
msgid "Do not cache search result pages"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-asl-admin.php:551
msgid ""
"Page caches (LiteSpeed, WP Rocket, W3 Total Cache...) serve cached search "
"pages without running WordPress, so those searches would be missing from the"
" logs."
msgstr ""

